WEBVTT

00:12:56.779 --> 00:13:03.575
including this idea that is woven in there
about the connectedness of knowledge

00:13:03.599 --> 00:13:06.679
that was sort of almost
revealed in the book

00:13:06.703 --> 00:13:09.575
as this growing wonder
and enchantment all of its own.

00:13:09.599 --> 00:13:11.041
It's really remarkable.

00:13:11.065 --> 00:13:13.226
But it started with
that curiosity journey.

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:16.708
EG: That's it -- "What am I going
to plant in this 10x10 piece of ground

00:13:16.732 --> 00:13:18.393
in my backyard?"

00:13:18.417 --> 00:13:22.615
And to be open to -- you don't need
to know why you're interested in this.

00:13:22.639 --> 00:13:25.938
It will be revealed
if you continue to investigate.

00:13:25.962 --> 00:13:28.568
That's it. That's all
that curiosity asks of you.

00:13:28.592 --> 00:13:31.265
Passion asks you to throw it
all on the bonfire,